Khaitan & Co advises Brookfield Asset Management on acquisition of eight warehousing assets from ESR Group

Khaitan & Co advised Brookfield Asset Management on its acquisition of a portfolio of eight warehousing assets across multiple cities from ESR Group. The firm’s role included transaction structuring, due diligence, preparation of transaction documents and procurement of a warranty and indemnity insurance policy.

Corporate diligence and insurance aspects: Meha Patel (Principal Associate), Vishnu Vasudevan Chengath (Senior Associate), Shrey Chhabra (Associate) and Shruti Milind Thakare (Associate);

Debt aspects: Dr Siddharth Srivastava (Partner) and Rashneet Kaur (Counsel);

Anti-trust aspects: Anisha Chand (Partner) and Yatharth V Singh (Senior Associate);

EIR diligence (solar installations): Dibyanshu (Partner), Sathyajith Nair (Principal Associate) and Shivam Gour (Associate);

Restructuring aspects: Vishnu Shriram (Partner).

The Firm role included preparation of diligence reports and transaction documents, structuring of the transaction, and procurement of W&I insurance policy.
